"person_id":"skr_sgj_x21","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0191","surface":"乂","start":191,"end":192,"person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0208","surface":"重","start":208,"end":209,"person_id":"axn_a9q_vzh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0213","surface":"含","start":213,"end":214,"person_id":"skr_sgj_x21","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0219","surface":"含","start":219,"end":220,"person_id":"skr_sgj_x21","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0224","surface":"重","start":224,"end":225,"person_id":"axn_a9q_vzh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0229","surface":"顒","start":229,"end":230,"person_id":"ed0_313_bea","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0235","surface":"游楷","start":235,"end":237,"person_id":"rni_u1p_55a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p001:m0242","surface":"韓稚","start":242,"end":244,"person_id":"3yq_f0p_3xx","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong","book_id":"b-jinshu-060","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong-ws2413335"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-huangfu-zhong:p002","text":"頃之，成都王穎與顒起兵共攻乂，以討后父尚書僕射羊玄之及商為名。乂以商為左將軍、河東太守，領萬餘人于關門距張方，為方所破，顒軍遂進。乂既屢敗，乃使商間行齎帝手詔，使遊楷盡罷兵，令重進軍討顒。商行過長安，至新平，遇其從甥，從甥素憎商，以告顒，顒捕得商，殺之。乂既敗，重猶堅守，閉塞外門，城內莫知，而四郡兵築土山攻城，重輒以連弩射之。所在為地窟以防外攻，權變百端，外軍不得近城，將士為之死戰。顒知不可拔，乃上表求遣御史宣詔喻之令降。重知非朝廷本意，不奉詔。獲御史騶人問曰：「我弟將兵來，欲至未？」騶云：「已為河間王所害。」重失色，立殺騶。於是城內知無外救，遂共殺重。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":48,"last_line":48,"raw_start":3419,"raw_end":3705,"raw_character_offsets":[3421,342